sg-csa-ccop-cii-oscal
=====================

This repository publishes OSCAL 1.1.2 conversion artifacts derived from the
Cybersecurity Code of Practice for Critical Information Infrastructure (CCoP)
issued by the Cyber Security Agency of Singapore under section 35A of the
Cybersecurity Act 2018.

Source documents
----------------

Title:    Cybersecurity Code of Practice for Critical Information Infrastructure
Issuer:   Cyber Security Agency of Singapore (CSA)
Legal:    section 35A, Cybersecurity Act 2018
Landing:  https://www.csa.gov.sg/legislation/codes-of-practice/

Releases included in this repository:

  Slug      Version                        Effective      Source PDF
  --------  -----------------------------  -------------  --------------------------------
  2022-r1   Second Edition, Revision 1     2022-12-12     CCoP---Second-Edition_Revision-One.pdf
  2026-r1   2026 Release 1                 2026-07-29     Cybersecurity Code of Practice (2026).pdf

The source content remains (c) Government of Singapore. The upstream PDFs
are the authoritative text; the OSCAL rendering in this repository is
unofficial.

The source PDFs are NOT redistributed from this repository. The `rlinks` in
each `catalog.json` point to the canonical CSA URL, and each PDF's SHA256 is
recorded in the matching `provenance.json` so that downstream consumers can
reproduce the exact build.

